#ASSERT `Was I victimised` TRUE `I made, or intend to make, a complaint` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Was I victimised` FALSE `I made, or intend to make, a complaint` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was I victimised` TRUE `another reason` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Was I victimised` TRUE `I alleged, or intend to allege, that a person did something that would contravene the Act` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was I victimised` TRUE `I alleged, or intend to allege, that a person did something that would contravene the Act` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE

