#ASSERT `Did they fail to accommodate my special need` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Did they fail to accommodate my special need` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Did they fail to accommodate my special need` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Must they let me alter the accommodation` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Must they let me alter the accommodation` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Must they let me alter the accommodation` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Must they let me alter the accommodation` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `Discriminatory advertising (s 25)`

#ASSERT `Was the advertisement prohibited` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Was the advertisement prohibited` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was the advertisement prohibited` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `Unnecessary information (s 26)`

#ASSERT `Was asking me for that information prohibited` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Was asking me for that information prohibited` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was asking me for that information prohibited` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was asking me for that information prohibited` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `Inciting hatred (ss 20A, 20B)`

-- Posted online (communicated to the public), no defence.
#ASSERT `Was the act inciting hatred prohibited` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `none of these purposes` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Said at a private dinner, nothing public: s 20A does not apply.
#ASSERT `Was the act inciting hatred prohibited` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE `none of these purposes` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Said "in private" but overheard from the street: taken not to be private (s 20A(3)(c)).
#ASSERT `Was the act inciting hatred prohibited` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE `none of these purposes` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- A fair and accurate news report, reasonably and in good faith (s 20B(c)(i)).
#ASSERT `Was the act inciting hatred prohibited` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE `a fair and accurate report of an event or matter of public interest` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Good faith but no s 20B purpose; and a purpose but not in good faith.
#ASSERT `Was the act inciting hatred prohibited` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE `none of these purposes` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Was the act inciting hatred prohibited` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `performing, exhibiting or distributing an artistic work` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Not reasonably likely to incite: outside s 20A's words.
#ASSERT `Was the act inciting hatred prohibited` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `none of these purposes` EQUALS NOTHING
-- In a public place.
#ASSERT `Was the act inciting hatred prohibited` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE `none of these purposes` EQUALS JUST TRUE

§§ `Who else is liable (ss 27, 105)`

#ASSERT `Is the person who caused or helped it liable too` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is the person who caused or helped it liable too` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Is the employer or principal liable too` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is the employer or principal liable too` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is the employer or principal liable too` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is the employer or principal liable too` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `Work exemptions (ss 35-37, 127)`

-- A work exemption with only the named facts set; the rest FALSE.
GIVEN e IS A `Work exemption`, a IS AN `Attribute`, `offering` IS A BOOLEAN, `restricted` IS A BOOLEAN, `terms` IS A BOOLEAN, `goq` IS A BOOLEAN, `inherent` IS A BOOLEAN, `home` IS A BOOLEAN, `rjp` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`work ex` e a `offering` `restricted` `terms` `goq` `inherent` `home` `rjp` MEANS
    `Does a work exemption cover it` e a `offering` `restricted` `terms` `goq` `inherent` `home` `rjp` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE

GIVEN `school` IS A BOOLEAN, a IS AN `Attribute`, `good faith` IS A BOOLEAN, `policy` IS A BOOLEAN, `at a school then` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`religious school ex` `school` a `good faith` `policy` `at a school then` MEANS
    `Does a work exemption cover it` `s 35B -- a religious educational institution` a FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `school` `good faith` `policy` `at a school then` FALSE FALSE FALSE

GIVEN e IS A `Work exemption`, a IS AN `Attribute`, `standard` IS A BOOLEAN, `vulnerable` IS A BOOLEAN, `necessary` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`age or record ex` e a `standard` `vulnerable` `necessary` MEANS
    `Does a work exemption cover it` e a FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `standard` `vulnerable` `necessary`

