    `Does a general exemption cover it` `s 56 -- competitive sport` `sex` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `restricting` r `reasonable` `under 12` `coaching` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE

